<title>GERMANY: MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-DOOHAN WINS GERMAN 500CC GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>NUERBURGRING, Germany 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Michael Doohan, riding a Honda, won the German 500cc motorcycling Grand Prix on Sunday.</p>
<p>Japan's Tadayuki Okada was second and Takuma Aoki, also of Japan and also on a Honda, was third.</p>
